Host-provided runtime dependencies

OpenSearch Dashboards 3.9.0 supplies the core APIs, React, React DOM,
OpenSearch UI (OUI, imported through @elastic/eui), and Elastic Charts.
The official plugin optimizer treats these browser libraries as host shared
dependencies. Their package directories are not bundled in this plugin ZIP.
OpenSearch Dashboards and OUI have their own Apache-2.0 notices; React and
React DOM have their own MIT notices. Retain the host distribution's licenses
and notices when distributing that host.

